@Service
public class PestReportService {
    report(ReportRequest req):
        validate zone exists else 404/422 -> 422 "库区不存在"? Use 422 unprocessable or 404. Zone code is path-independent body field; use 422. I'll use unprocessable("库区不存在: X").
